  "body": "We have an attribute on USBInterface to get the current alternate setting. There's probably no perfect way for us to cache this information to make it available synchronously, so we should always query the device instead. Should change to an async interface:\n\n```\nPromise<octet> getAlternateSetting();\n```\n",
